{"ref":"BDB, אִגֶּ֫רֶת","hw":"אִגֶּ֫רֶת","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִגֶּ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. letter, letter-missive (</strong>late, prob. loan-word, As. <em>egirtu</em> Dl<sup>W</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.8\">Ne 2:8</a> + 2 textual; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:29\" href=\"/Esther.9.29\">Est 9:29</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִגְּרוֹת</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.1\">2 Ch 30:1</a> + 3 textual; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.9\">Ne 2:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִגְּרֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.17\">Ne 6:17</a>—<em>letter</em>, especially royal letter <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.1\">2 Ch 30:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.6\">6</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.7\">Ne 2:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.9\">9</a>; but also others <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.5\">Ne 6:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:26\" href=\"/Esther.9.26\">Es 9:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:29\" href=\"/Esther.9.29\">29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סֵפֶר</span> vv <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:20\" href=\"/Esther.9.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:30\" href=\"/Esther.9.30\">30</a>; other syn. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְתָּב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁתְּוָן</span> q.v.)","next":"BDB, אֲגַרְטָל","prev":"BDB, אֲגוֹרָה"}